  requires the author's prior written permission.
- Institution-specific content (in-house TDM targets, formulary items and strengths,
  order codes, sampling windows, in-house dosing conventions, anything marked
  "院內" or "本院") belongs to the author's institution and is NOT licensed.
  Do not use it as your own institution's rules, do not present it as the institution's
  official guidance, do not use the institution's name or marks, and replace it with
  your own institution's rules before use.
- Literature-derived values belong to their original authors and publishers.
- Not a medical device; no regulatory review; not a substitute for professional judgment.
- No patient data is collected; users are responsible for privacy compliance.
- No warranty; no liability to the extent permitted by law.
- Versions released earlier under the MIT License remain under MIT for those versions.
